/* blind-fight-god.irh -- fixture for tools/check_blind_fight_miss.sh (bd
   inc-4k2). One test god. Joining it (wizard mode "Become Divine Champion")
   throws EV_BLESSING once with 30000 favour (src/Debug.cpp:1118-1135), and
   the FAVOUR_CHART below is copied from tools/fixtures/periodic-interval-
   gods.irh: its first rung (1000) sits under 30000 and its second (50000)
   over it, so a fresh follower always lands on level 1 and this handler fires
   exactly once, never again on the same character. The one-shot guard is
   getGodLevel(...)==1, the same gate periodic-interval-gods.irh uses.

   The blessing grants the follower FT_BLIND_FIGHT directly via GainFeat
   (inc/Api.h:454), the call lib/classes.irh:1442 makes to grant a feat. That
   makes the ATTACKER hold the Blind-Fight feat deterministically, whatever
   the seed rolled at character generation.

   NOT part of the shipped module: tools/check_blind_fight_miss.sh splices
   this file onto the END of a scratch copy of lib/main.irc, under logs/, for
   the span of its own run only. No tracked lib/ file is ever touched. */

God "Blind Fight Test God"
  {
    Lists:
      * FAVOUR_CHART
          1000
          50000
          60000
          70000
          80000
          90000
          100000
          110000
          120000
          130000;
    On Event EV_BLESSING {
      if (EActor->getGodLevel($"Blind Fight Test God") == 1)
        EActor->GainFeat(FT_BLIND_FIGHT);
      return NOTHING;
      };
  }
